 "text": "Bullish EMA trends = Here's the cheat sheet ⬇️\n\nAbove 200 EMA = Bullish \nAbove 200 + 48 EMA = More Bullish\nAbove 200 + 48 + 13 EMA = Mega Bullish \n\nThe strongest upside momentum happens when...\n\n13 EMA on top 🟡\n48 EMA in middle 🟣\n200 EMA on bottom 🔴\n\nStudy this bullish price https://t.co/hd97dc7iPP",
